and determined their dates.It does not provide any information about whether fossils of different species found in the same place belong to different periods or not.\n\nIn the past 22,000 years, the tolerable temperature of beetles has changed significantly.\n- This assumption is not explicitly stated in the context. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
