ng to relevant national and regulations of law, Li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\n- This option describes a legal transaction between two parties, where Li signs a house sales contract.The judiciary organs apply the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures. It is not a contractual action between two parties.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
