on, special poverty, typical demonstration**\n\n* "Precise poverty alleviation" is mentioned in the context, but it\'s not the main focus of the passage.\n* "Special poverty" is mentioned, but it\'s not the primary keyword.\n* "Typical demonstration" is mentioned, but it\'s not the main focus either.\n\n**Option C: Poor groups, macro background, information society**\n\n* "Poor groups" is mentioned in the context, but it\'s not the main focus of the passage.\nThe main focus is on "Macro background" and "Information society" is the primary keyword. \n\n**Option B: Rich individuals, general wealth, basic education**\n\n"Rich individuals" are the central theme in the passage, and "general wealth" is the main focus. "Basic education" is mentioned, but it\'s not the primary keyword.\n\nAccording to the analysis, the most suitable keyword taken from the passage is "rich individuals" (Option B). The passage underscores the significance of recognizing and adjusting to the new circumstance of informatization and networking for wealthy individuals, rather than concentrating on specific details or general wealth.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
