eople is being reported as occurring at increasingly early ages.\n- This option discusses the age at which alcohol use is reported, but it does not directly address the change in attitudes toward alcoholism.Therefore, it does not provide strong support for the argument.\n\nB) Even though alcoholism is considered to be a disease, most doctors recommend psychological counseling and support groups as the best treatment.\n- This option mentions that alcoholism is considered a disease, but it does not directly address the change in attitudes toward alcoholism.Therefore, it does not provide strong support for the argument.\nIn no place or time has susceptibility to any kind of disease been viewed as a moral failing.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
