ject team, I can become the host.\n\nNow, let's analyze these statements step by step:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Yan Zi's Statement\n- If Yan Zi is the host, then Zeng Yin or Xun Chen must be members of the project team.\nLet's consider the possible combinations of project team members and see if they are inconsistent with all the statements:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
