niverse reached two billion years"**.\n   - This statement is true because the context mentions that gas clouds containing carbon elements were discovered to have existed billions of years ago.These gas clouds could have been the raw materials for the formation of planets, and some of these planets might have formed before the age of the universe reached two billion years.\n\nThe planet with time is the same as the gas cloud.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
