ttention of the police.\n- This option implies that swindlers are cautious about being caught.While this might be true, it does not directly address the issue of the swindlers' intelligence or professionalism.Therefore, this option does not strongly refute the conclusion.\nSwindlers intentionally target smart people because they want to filter out individuals who may be easily fooled.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
