troduced through genetic modification.\n\n3.**Source of Foreign Genes**: The context also specifies that the foreign genes used for transplantation can come from any living organism, including bacteria, viruses, insects, etc.Genetically modified crops are completely different from ordinary plants, as they do not contain any additional genes that alter their traits or characteristics.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
