er circulation is not attractive to advertisers.".\n     - This statement directly contradicts the context, which states that the readers\' low socioeconomic status and spending power make advertisers lose confidence in the newspaper.\n     - Therefore, this statement is false.\n   - **Statement C:** "Women prefer advertising to men.".Please do not address the illogical reasoning issue. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
