on.\n\n4.**Evaluate Each Option:**\n   - **Option A:** "Whether exposed to some kind of radiation or not, letting mice eat the food they normally eat increases the likelihood of leukemia."\n     - This statement is not supported by the data.The unrestricted group (which ate their normal food) had a higher incidence of leukemia than the restricted group (which ate less food).\n   - **Option B:** "For any kind of mouse, leukemia has nothing to do with exposure to some kind of radiation."\n     - This statement is also not supported by the data.The restricted group, which was not exposed to radiation, had a higher incidence of leukemia than the unrestricted group, which was exposed to radiation.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
