es of which it is a variation."\nThis statement also aligns with the context, as it mentions that careful analysis can reveal previous themes.Therefore, this statement must be true.\n\n**Option C:**All new scientific discoveries represent, on a deep level, a variation on previous themes.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
