 actually reflects the responsiveness of demand to cost changes, not price changes.Cost changes would be reflected in the price elasticity of demand, not supply.This statement is correct.\n\n**Option D:**.\n- According to the law of supply and demand, there can be no commodity with \\( EP < 1 \\).This is correct because all goods have elastic demand, where a change in price significantly affects the quantity demanded.This statement is correct.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
