l vote, Li Zilu also ticked them.\n\n4.**Applying the Deductions:**.\n   - Let's assume Zhao Jie was ticked by someone (let's call them Candidate X).\n   - Since Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie, Wang Ming also ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Since Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote, if Zhao Jie did not get the full vote, Li Zilu also ticked Zhao Jie.Based on the above information, it can be concluded that Wang Ming and Li Zilu didn't tick each other.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
