The main body of entrepreneurship will move from the elite to the public.\n- While this option is mentioned in the context, it is not the primary focus.The context emphasizes the creation of an institutional environment rather than the movement of entrepreneurship subjects.\n\nC) Mechanism and system hinder the realization of human value.\nThe main focus is on protecting people's value, not on creating an institutional environment for entrepreneurship and innovation.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
