ral.\n   - **Option B:** "A substance is unnatural only if the function it serves is unnatural.".\n     - This option does not directly relate to the origins of the substance\'s components.It focuses on the function rather than the origin.\n   - **Option C:** "A substance is no more natural than its least natural component.Therefore, the correct answer is not Option A.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
